1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,872
I just sold eight hours of tonight's sleep for enough cash to pay my tuition.

2
00:00:05,172 --> 00:00:11,316
The nurse plugged a thick silver cable straight into the base of my skull without a warning.

3
00:00:11,616 --> 00:00:17,304
They said my brain would just take a harmless little vacation while I made easy money.

4
00:00:17,604 --> 00:00:23,844
When I woke up, my room felt wrong. The air smelled like expensive cedar and old money.

5
00:00:24,144 --> 00:00:30,720
I looked down at my hands. These fingers were older, scarred from a fencing foil I never held.

6
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:36,852
My phone buzzed on the marble counter. A calendar alert flashed for a corporate board meeting.

7
00:00:37,152 --> 00:00:43,632
I didn't rent out empty space. I rented out a vessel, and now I am trapped inside.

8
00:00:43,932 --> 00:00:50,052
Downstairs in the lobby, a security guard looked right at me and called me by the CEO's name.

9
00:00:50,352 --> 00:00:56,280
I am funding my college degree by letting a billionaire borrow my youth while he steals my day.

10
00:00:56,580 --> 00:01:02,748
Tonight I go back to the clinic. But when I close my eyes, whose life am I funding?
